Recommends: pandoc
Description: GTK4 Markdown viewer for Xfce
 Markdown Viewer is a lightweight viewer (not an editor) for Markdown files,
 built with GTK4 and WebKitGTK for the Xfce desktop. Launch it with the
 md-viewer command or open .md files from your file manager.
 .
 Supports GitHub Flavored Markdown, CommonMark, original Markdown and PHP
 Markdown Extra out of the box; with pandoc installed, also Pandoc Markdown,
 MultiMarkdown and R Markdown. Documents are styled with CSS, and you can add
 your own styles.
